- Yes, we do.

34
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,520
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

35
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,320
<i>That day, we drank a lot.</i>

36
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:35,440
<i>The boys puked everywhere.</i>

37
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:42,480
<i>Life forces us to be invincible.</i>

38
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:47,840
<i>But everything will come to an end.</i>

39
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,760
