but make sure he stays away from me.

62
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:22,000
Don't worry. He's an introvert.
He won't approach you.

63
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,400
Good boy.

64
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:34,120
