218
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,040
It's centered.

219
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,880
Lei, can you carry the sofa with me?

220
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,840
Sure.

221
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,320
<i>It's my third year in Beijing.</i>

222
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:15,440
<i>I'm so incredibly lucky</i>
<i>to have moved into this unit.</i>

223
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:22,720
<i>My flatmates in 301</i>
<i>are my family in Beijing.</i>

224
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:29,160
<i>For the first time in my life,</i>
<i>this city feels like home.</i>

225
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:40,040
BE HAPPY TODAY

226
