Sit.

261
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,640
Come here.

262
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,480
Sit.

263
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Lazy dog.

264
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:33,280
He likes you a lot.

265
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:38,360
Shang Zhitao.

266
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:41,840
Let's go to the bar
in the mountains tomorrow.

267
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,040
Okay.

268
00:18:49,280 --> 00:18:50,520
Let's go, silly dog.

269
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:52,440
Let's go.

270
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:01,560
- What do you think?
- The renovation is already done?

271
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:04,200
It looks good.

272
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,480
- Luke.
- Luke, come here.

273
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,600
This is better than I imagined.

274
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:17,600
Do you like it?

275
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:20,640
I love your renovation choices.

276
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:25,320
Let Luke roam freely.

277
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,920
Go, Luke. Don't pee or poop anywhere.

278
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,320
He won't.

279
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:39,480
Once the glassware is here, you will
have the first drink from the bartender.

280
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:42,480
When is the bartender coming?

281
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:51,080
You know how to mix drinks?

282
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:55,400
When this place opens to the public,
you will be our first client.

283
00:19:56,120 --> 00:19:58,040
And you shall witness my mixing skills.

284
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,760
For the moment,
I can only make you sky juice.

285
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:04,400
Sky juice? Just call it mineral water.

286
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:10,840
Luke.

287
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,400
Come and drink.

288
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,360
Luke.

289
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:16,880
Come. Luke.

290
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,880
Don't drink this one for the opening day.

291
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,240
My friend gave me a bottle
of 25-year-old whiskey.

292
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,160
Allow me to introduce.

293
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:46,360
This is Shang Zhitao.

294
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,880
I don't have to introduce myself.

295
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,400
I've already met her.

296
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:53,320
This is our first meeting.
I am Song Qiuhan.

297
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:56,160
We are Luke's best friends from school.

298
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:58,680
Listen. I've known him for many years,

299
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:01,680
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

300
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:06,920
Come, Ms. Shang.

301
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,760
What an honor.

302
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:12,280
I finally met you.

303
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:14,720
- Now that I've met you…
- Are you out of your mind?

304
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:17,240
Now that I've met you, I see you
not only raise a good dog,

305
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,840
but also do a good job managing Luke.

306
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:22,560
Are you sick? What are you trying to say?

307
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,040
I'm saying you are obedient.

308
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:27,800
When it comes to obedience,
no one can outdo a simp like you.

309
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,640
We're the same.

310
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:38,480
Luke, what made you decide
to open a bar here?

311
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:40,880
Even if it doesn't make any money,
won't you want to recoup your cost?

312
00:21:41,480 --> 00:21:43,080
Exactly. It's a remote place.

313
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,920
How is it going to be successful?

314
00:21:46,480 --> 00:21:47,960
Speaking of business,

315
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:52,760
all of you have a share in this bar.

316
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:54,320
A surprise?

317
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:58,360
Share Purchase Agreement.

318
00:21:58,440 --> 00:22:00,080
What is the meaning of this?

319
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:02,520
Does this mean we will be jointly liable
if this business fails?

320
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:05,160
This bar is not open to the public,

321
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,720
but it's fully booked this week.

322
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:10,040
The Anns from Fumei Group
and Ruixing Group

323
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,880
will be here for an event
in the next two days.

324
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:14,960
Next week, the newly appointed
Mr. Guan of Yuanjing will be here.

325
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,920
It's not open to the public,

326
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:22,920
meaning it's like a private club.

327
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:26,680
- See?
- It seems like we are too shortsighted.

328
00:22:26,760 --> 00:22:30,520
When it comes to running a bar,
you are much better than Song.

329
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:32,440
I didn't know
you had such business acumen.

330
00:22:32,520 --> 00:22:34,480
Otherwise, I really should have asked you
to run my bar back then.

331
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:36,760
Why should I work for you?

332
00:22:36,840 --> 00:22:38,360
Right. You'll be the boss.

333
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,240
- I wouldn't have lost so much money.
- Exactly.

334
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:43,160
- Come.
- Drink up.

335
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,120
Come.

336
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,320
<i>Allow me to introduce.</i>

337
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:14,240
This is Shang Zhitao.

338
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:15,320
I've known him for many years,

339
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:18,520
and this is the first time
he has introduced his girlfriend to us.

340
00:23:55,040 --> 00:24:01,000
THANK YOU FOR YOUR HOSPITALITY
SORRY FOR THE TROUBLE!

341
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:08,880
HARBIN

342
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,920
LAOLIANGKOU RESTAURANT

343
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:11,040
Here it is.

344
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,760
Luke, I'll take you to visit relatives
on Chinese New Year's Day.

345
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,240
Coming.

346
00:24:16,320 --> 00:24:17,640
- Wow.
- Two more dishes.

347
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:19,120
- Hey, my good boy.
- Come.

348
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,400
Have you learned
how to bow with your paws?

349
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:23,480
If you have, you'll get the red envelopes,

350
00:24:23,560 --> 00:24:25,040
and then, I'll buy meat for you.

351
00:24:25,800 --> 00:24:28,120
Mom, don't feed him meat.
He'll eat kibble.

352
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,240
Meat is too salty.

353
00:24:29,840 --> 00:24:32,320
Luke, Grandpa will light firecrackers
with you later.

354
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:34,520
Grandpa? Dad, you sure are eager
to be a grandpa.

355
00:24:34,600 --> 00:24:36,080
He's one of our family members.

356
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:38,640
Come. It's all your favorite.

357
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:40,880
- Aren't they good?
- They are perfect.

358
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:42,240
- Dig in.
- Dig in.

359
00:24:42,320 --> 00:24:44,200
I'm heading to Suzhou
after Chinese New Year

360
00:24:44,280 --> 00:24:45,320
for more than two months
for my business trip.

361
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:47,560
- I have to eat more now.
- Come. Dig in.

362
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:50,920
- You've worked hard, Tao.
- Come. Look.

363
00:24:56,520 --> 00:24:57,360
Come.

364
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,320
Cheers.

365
00:25:01,280 --> 00:25:02,120
Oh.

366
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Last night, Zang Yao came to me.

367
00:25:06,080 --> 00:25:09,000
She was drunk, and she cried a lot.

368
00:25:09,600 --> 00:25:12,760
She said she wanted to let go of you.

369
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:15,040
Like for real this time.

370
00:25:16,800 --> 00:25:18,520
It'll only do her good.

371
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:21,120
She said she finally realized

372
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:23,760
that Shang Zhitao was special to you.

373
00:25:23,840 --> 00:25:25,880
She has never seen you like this before.

374
00:25:28,840 --> 00:25:30,280
I know why you did what you did,

375
00:25:30,360 --> 00:25:33,240
but we grew up with Zang Yao.

376
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:35,440
You could have been kinder to her.

377
00:25:35,520 --> 00:25:38,440
What? Is giving her
false hopes kindness now?

378
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:42,680
All right. Stop criticizing Luan Nian.

379
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:45,240
Luke. Tell us honestly.

380
00:25:45,760 --> 00:25:47,640
Is this a serious relationship or not?

381
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:49,440
I've never fooled around
with my relationships.

382
00:25:50,800 --> 00:25:52,160
Right.

383
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:54,720
How come you didn't bring
Ms. Shang home for Chinese New Year?

384
00:25:55,840 --> 00:25:58,920
- It's none of your business.
- Okay.

385
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,840
<i>Happy Chinese New Year.</i>

386
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:09,520
<i>I wish you well.</i>

387
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:12,800
<i>Happy Chinese New Year.</i>
<i>May your Luke grow bigger.</i>

388
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:15,000
Happy Chinese New Year. Cheers.

389
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:16,480
- Come. Happy Chinese New Year.
- Happy Chinese New Year.

390
00:26:16,560 --> 00:26:18,600
Happy Chinese New Year.

391
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,040
ONE MONTH LATER, SUZHOU

392
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,440
- Just put it here.
- Sure.

393
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:55,680
Thank you so much.

394
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:57,080
<i>You and Yuanzhu went on a business trip.</i>

395
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,680
<i>I'll take care of our home. Don't worry.</i>

396
00:26:58,760 --> 00:27:00,000
<i>I'm taking good care of Luke as well.</i>

397
00:27:00,080 --> 00:27:01,680
I knew I could count on you.

398
00:27:01,760 --> 00:27:03,000
Luan Nian will be here soon.

399
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:05,040
- I'm waiting for him here.
- <i>Okay.</i>

400
00:27:05,120 --> 00:27:06,080
- <i>I will be home soon.</i>
- Flora.

401
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:08,080
Mr. Wang.

402
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,840
You have worked hard in the past month.

403
00:27:09,920 --> 00:27:11,520
I heard Luke would be here.

404
00:27:11,600 --> 00:27:13,160
- Yes. He…
- Flora.

405
00:27:30,760 --> 00:27:32,480
Morning, Luke.

406
00:27:34,160 --> 00:27:35,960
This is Mr. Wang
from the event management company.

407
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:37,400
This is our boss, Luke.

408
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:39,560
You must have had a long journey.

409
00:27:40,440 --> 00:27:42,360
I'll book a private room
to treat you and Flora

410
00:27:42,440 --> 00:27:44,760
- to a meal.
- Sure.

411
00:27:44,840 --> 00:27:46,560
But we can have the meal anytime.

412
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:48,600
We have a conference soon.

413
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,280
How is the progress?

414
00:27:52,800 --> 00:27:53,760
The setup is almost done.

415
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:56,240
The guest reception
has been duly arranged.

416
00:27:56,320 --> 00:27:58,800
The rehearsal will begin at 3 p.m.

417
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,960
Go to the venue
and double-check the schedule.

418
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:03,920
Then, bring your team with you
for a meeting.

419
00:28:05,360 --> 00:28:06,680
I shall wait for you two at the venue.

420
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:08,480
Let me know if you need me.

421
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:30,800
I think your creative proposal

422
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:32,720
does not align
with the client's strategic direction.

423
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,240
What do the people think on your end?

424
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:35,840
<i>Well, Mr. Luan.</i>

425
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:39,800
<i>Let me bring you up to speed</i>
<i>regarding our comments.</i>

426
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:43,360
<i>We are now pushing</i>
<i>for a collaboration with the brand.</i>

427
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:46,640
<i>We hope to leverage their resources</i>
<i>to increase our visibility.</i>

428
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:49,160
<i>It's cheap and boosts our visibility.</i>

429
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:51,400
<i>The client wants us</i>
<i>to expand the target audience</i>

430
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:53,400
<i>to the younger generation.</i>

431
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,760
- <i>So the idea</i>
- Bring me a bottle of water.

432
00:28:54,840 --> 00:28:56,160
<i>has to be surprising.</i>

433
00:28:56,240 --> 00:29:00,480
<i>Given the current media trend,</i>
<i>we can use videos,</i>

434
00:29:00,560 --> 00:29:04,120
<i>product placements,</i>
<i>or targeted placement in vertical markets.</i>

435
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,560
<i>It's sort of like digital menus.</i>

436
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,560
<i>But we also have a more traditional idea,</i>

437
00:29:08,640 --> 00:29:10,840
<i>which is more aligned</i>
<i>with the brand's direction.</i>

438
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:11,840
Carry on.

439
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:13,000
<i>Working with online content,</i>

440
00:29:13,080 --> 00:29:15,840
<i>we have selected five major influencers</i>
<i>on Weibo whose tone matches our brand</i>

441
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:17,440
<i>and bloggers in vertical fields.</i>

442
00:29:17,520 --> 00:29:21,640
<i>They cover fashion, lifestyle,</i>
<i>tech, and digital products.</i>

443
00:29:21,720 --> 00:29:24,400
<i>As for the frequency,</i>
<i>we allocate three days to build hype,</i>

444
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:26,520
<i>two days for peak days,</i>
<i>and one week for the long tail period.</i>

445
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:32,560
<i>We will send you the influencer</i>
<i>fan profiles and audience overlap data</i>

446
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,960
<i>with our target brand audience by tonight.</i>

447
00:29:34,600 --> 00:29:37,960
<i>As for physical events, we have come up</i>
<i>with three interactive segments.</i>

448
00:29:38,040 --> 00:29:39,880
<i>The first one is a flash mob.</i>

449
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:43,720
<i>The second is a QR code</i>
<i>that unlocks our brand's history.</i>

450
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,400
<i>And the third one is the Weibo mega screen</i>

451
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:47,360
- Take the meeting minutes.
- <i>that visitors can interact with.</i>

452
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:50,800
<i>We estimate more</i>
<i>than 3,000 visitors per show.</i>

453
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:51,960
I see.

454
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:54,720
I think we can swap the order
of these two proposals.

455
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:56,160
<i>Okay.</i>

456
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,640
<i>It's around 7 p.m. now.</i>
<i>Let's take a break.</i>

457
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:11,640
- <i>A 40-minute dinner break.</i>
- Okay.

458
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:14,040
- <i>We'll continue after the meal.</i>
- Hello. It's the food delivery.

459
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,080
Pardon me.

460
00:30:24,560 --> 00:30:25,680
Enjoy your meal.

461
00:30:27,040 --> 00:30:28,080
Thank you.

462
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,080
Let's eat.

463
00:30:44,360 --> 00:30:45,400
Did you miss me?

464
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:53,840
You've been on this business trip
for a long time.

465
00:30:55,040 --> 00:30:56,040
Have you ever missed me?

466
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:30,440
Is everyone here? Let's begin.

467
00:31:30,520 --> 00:31:35,400
<i>Sure, Mr. Luan. So, we chose</i>
<i>a venue next to Taihu Lake this time.</i>

468
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:38,280
<i>It fits perfectly with this year's</i>
<i>Traditional Chinese-style initiative,</i>

469
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:41,040
<i>the localization of international brands,</i>

470
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:44,480
<i>and the brand's re-invigoration</i>
<i>of traditional culture.</i>

471
00:31:44,560 --> 00:31:47,120
<i>They are trending topics at the moment.</i>

472
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:51,680
<i>And the latest strategy in Lime China</i>
<i>is to study the local culture</i>

473
00:31:51,760 --> 00:31:53,160
<i>to bring out the Chinese spirit.</i>

474
00:31:53,240 --> 00:31:54,280
Tell me more about the itinerary.

475
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,400
Please confirm
the subsequent marketing plans

476
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,960
- with me today as well.
- <i>I will send the itinerary to you soon.</i>

477
00:31:59,040 --> 00:32:00,040
<i>As for the marketing plans,</i>

478
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:01,280
<i>we will conduct a survey</i>
<i>with the Creative Division</i>

479
00:32:01,360 --> 00:32:02,360
<i>before finalizing them.</i>

480
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:05,680
All right. Good work.
That's all for today's meeting.

481
00:32:05,760 --> 00:32:06,800
<i>Sure.</i>

482
00:32:16,960 --> 00:32:18,200
Hello?

483
00:32:18,280 --> 00:32:20,400
<i>The headquarters are planning</i>
<i>to bring in a general manager.</i>

484
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,480
<i>Are you aware of it?</i>

485
00:32:26,120 --> 00:32:27,040
We'll speak later.

486
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:33,840
I have to go now.

487
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:36,760
You won't stay here?

488
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:40,080
No.

489
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:44,480
I need to check on the progress
and write the work report.

490
00:32:47,760 --> 00:32:50,360
Do you know how to write one?
Do you need my help?

491
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,080
No need.

492
00:32:53,600 --> 00:32:55,880
I don't need your help
to get my promotion.

493
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:58,320
Thank you for the offer, Mr. Luan.

494
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:00,760
I'll send you some insider websites later.

495
00:33:00,840 --> 00:33:02,440
Other than working hard,

496
00:33:02,520 --> 00:33:04,640
knowing how to demonstrate
your growth and achievement

497
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:07,000
is very important at work as well.

498
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:16,880
Are you actually helping me?

499
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:20,360
Shang Zhitao.

500
00:33:22,520 --> 00:33:23,840
I hope you'll get the promotion

501
00:33:24,840 --> 00:33:26,560
because you have achieved many things

502
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,600
and have a great working attitude.

503
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:33,160
Your brain is also better than before.

504
00:33:37,520 --> 00:33:39,000
Is that a compliment?

505
00:33:40,520 --> 00:33:42,480
Didn't you tell me
to compliment you occasionally?

506
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:08,639
Tao.

507
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:10,480
You're finally back.

508
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:13,280
Your business trip was so long.
How was it?

509
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,440
It was okay.

510
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,320
What?

511
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:22,760
We have a new general manager now.

512
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:24,280
He's on the same level as Luke.

513
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:28,679
- What do you mean?
- His name is Dony.

514
00:34:28,760 --> 00:34:30,960
A pretentious elite who returned to China.

515
00:34:31,040 --> 00:34:33,520
Apparently, the board sent him here.

516
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:34,600
I did my research.

517
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:36,719
His resume is as impressive as Luke's.

518
00:34:36,800 --> 00:34:38,600
There's a rumor recently saying

519
00:34:38,679 --> 00:34:40,120
that Luan Nian will become
the general manager.

520
00:34:40,199 --> 00:34:41,480
Then, he suddenly appears.

521
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,480
It's fishy.

522
00:34:45,120 --> 00:34:46,679
They don't want Luke
to become too powerful.

523
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:48,080
They want to keep him in check.

524
00:34:48,960 --> 00:34:51,000
It's not a good thing, I'm sure.

525
00:34:56,080 --> 00:34:59,160
What is your opinion regarding
the investment ratio of the new media?

526
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:03,280
I think we can study the recent--

527
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,880
Sorry for the interruption.

528
00:35:07,640 --> 00:35:09,040
Allow me to introduce.

529
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:11,440
This is the new general manager
of the Business Division,

530
00:35:11,520 --> 00:35:14,200
Dony. He will be in charge
of the new media marketing strategy.

531
00:35:15,120 --> 00:35:16,200
Welcome on board.

532
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:21,240
The headquarters wants him
to join today's meeting.

533
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,440
I'll let you guys work.

534
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:29,640
Luke. I've heard about you.

535
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:31,520
I look forward to working with you.

536
00:35:32,040 --> 00:35:33,200
Likewise.

537
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:36,480
We were talking about next year's
new media marketing proposal.

538
00:35:36,560 --> 00:35:37,640
Join us.

539
00:35:38,160 --> 00:35:40,800
I've read the proposal before I came here.

540
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:44,720
I think it can use some new ideas.

541
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:47,680
We are now in the digital era.

542
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,920
Independent media outlets
have become influential.

543
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:55,040
The interaction between users
and media shouldn't remain unchanged.

544
00:35:55,640 --> 00:36:00,240
We must inject new life into the image
for better user interaction

545
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:02,720
and retention rate. Don't you agree?

546
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:08,640
Right.

547
00:36:09,240 --> 00:36:11,040
You want an A/B test.

548
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,920
We at Lime support new strategies
and different perspectives.

549
00:36:14,600 --> 00:36:15,440
I look forward to reading your proposal.

550
00:36:16,640 --> 00:36:17,640
Thank you, Luke.

551
00:36:18,160 --> 00:36:19,680
Let's go over this again.

552
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:21,480
Sure. Carry on without me.

553
00:36:22,160 --> 00:36:23,840
I have a meeting later, don't I?

554
00:36:25,640 --> 00:36:29,120
And welcome. Familiarize yourself
with our work.

555
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:32,160
If you have time,
you can take a walk outside too.

556
00:36:32,240 --> 00:36:33,440
Beijing has changed a lot.

557
00:36:46,080 --> 00:36:47,480
You must be Flora.

558
00:36:49,120 --> 00:36:50,360
Dony.

559
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:54,560
I was told you handled the cases
regarding new media marketing.

560
00:36:56,840 --> 00:37:01,400
I need to relaunch several projects.
Can you help me?

561
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:06,040
Sure. Let me know if you need me.

562
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:07,520
I definitely need your assistance.

563
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:11,120
I'll ask my division to send you
the meeting notification as well.

564
00:37:11,720 --> 00:37:15,080
Do it well. I have plenty of opportunities
for you to shine.

565
00:37:16,200 --> 00:37:18,840
- Okay.
- Go back to your work.

566
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:26,600
Dony?

567
00:37:29,360 --> 00:37:30,480
Why him of all people?

568
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,680
And parachuted into the office as well?

569
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:38,160
He's up to no good.

570
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:40,080
What rotten luck.

571
00:37:41,720 --> 00:37:43,480
Luan Nian has a history with him.

572
00:37:45,560 --> 00:37:47,360
I told you that a guy
betrayed Luan Nian back then.

573
00:37:48,240 --> 00:37:49,600
He was that guy.

574
00:37:52,240 --> 00:37:53,880
They are our rivals.

575
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:55,640
What did they offer you?

576
00:37:56,240 --> 00:37:59,040
You took my core idea as your ticket in.

577
00:37:59,120 --> 00:38:01,200
I spent three months working on it.

578
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:07,640
What is the meaning of this?

579
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,720
You can't say it was your effort alone.

580
00:38:10,800 --> 00:38:13,240
I was the one who dealt with the client.

581
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:15,760
If you don't want to work with me,
you may leave.

582
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,320
The company can be closed down.

583
00:38:17,400 --> 00:38:20,040
But you took my core idea
and sold it to our rivals

584
00:38:20,120 --> 00:38:22,920
to use it against me. Now that's betrayal.

585
00:38:23,520 --> 00:38:24,760
Do you have no shame?

586
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,040
We were brothers.

587
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:29,080
I do not think I did you wrong.

588
00:38:29,160 --> 00:38:32,400
You know very well this company
has burned through all its cash.

589
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:35,360
Yes, you are rich,

590
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:36,600
but I'm not.

591
00:38:37,200 --> 00:38:38,280
I cannot run on an empty stomach

592
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:41,040
to waste time with you
on your so-called pursuit of perfection.

593
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:43,760
The priority for this company
is to survive.

594
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:45,440
You're committing a crime.

595
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,440
I'm seeking legal action.

596
00:38:58,680 --> 00:39:02,040
I really hate that you always
put on that artist act.

597
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:04,000
You think you're the only genius?

598
00:39:04,080 --> 00:39:08,560
Without me, your unrealistic idea
has no value.

599
00:39:08,640 --> 00:39:10,440
It's just a pipe dream. Do you get it?

600
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:13,440
Whether it's a pipe dream or not

601
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:16,160
does not mean
I can't kick you out of this place.

602
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:26,840
‪WHISPERING PEAKS CREATIVE STUDIO

603
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:39,320
I didn't want to tell you all this,

604
00:39:39,840 --> 00:39:43,480
but I know you are special to Luke.

605
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:47,640
As you already know, he is a prideful man.

606
00:39:48,160 --> 00:39:51,200
Even though you now know the story,
do not bring it up in front of him.

607
00:40:15,840 --> 00:40:17,280
Can you mix a drink for me?

608
00:40:37,720 --> 00:40:38,880
A special drink.

609
00:40:41,520 --> 00:40:42,520
What is it called?

610
00:40:43,520 --> 00:40:44,680
It has no name.

611
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,120
No name?

612
00:40:47,240 --> 00:40:48,320
I'll name it then.

613
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,360
Let's call it

614
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,240
One Heart.

615
00:40:58,560 --> 00:40:59,840
What are you getting at?

616
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:05,200
Lumi told me that Dony
had a complicated background.

617
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:08,920
Not only did he ask me
to join his new project,

618
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:12,080
but he also asked several other
key employees to join him.

619
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:16,360
That's work for you.
Things are not simple.

620
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:20,000
If someone asks you to pick a side,
will you do it?

621
00:41:20,840 --> 00:41:23,400
Pick his side,
and I might become your enemy.

622
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:25,920
If you don't, you might be eliminated.

623
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:30,320
I will never betray you.

624
00:41:36,120 --> 00:41:37,480
And I will never
put my guard up against you.

625
00:41:46,120 --> 00:41:48,960
Oh. I have a business trip in two days.

626
00:41:49,040 --> 00:41:51,440
Can you look after Luke for me?

627
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:55,200
No. Because I might cook him.

628
00:41:57,080 --> 00:41:58,360
Sure.

629
00:41:58,920 --> 00:42:00,520
Why don't you cook me first?

630
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:02,120
Cook me first, then cook him next.

631
00:42:02,200 --> 00:42:04,840
You're not delicious
because you lack a brain.

632
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:10,320
You…

633
00:42:11,440 --> 00:42:13,520
That won't work, Shang Zhitao.

634
00:42:15,160 --> 00:42:16,080
No.

635
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:18,680
Please.

636
00:42:19,720 --> 00:42:21,600
Take care of him, please?

637
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:24,640
If he pees in my room, I'll smack him.

638
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:28,000
If he bites my things, I'll smack him too.

639
00:42:29,520 --> 00:42:32,480
Okay. He needs
to be responsible for his actions.

640
00:42:32,560 --> 00:42:33,800
Smack him.

641
00:42:37,600 --> 00:42:39,080
Do you like it?

642
00:42:40,640 --> 00:42:43,640
I can take three of it
without any problem.

643
00:42:43,720 --> 00:42:45,800
Aren't I amazing? Have I improved myself?

644
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:47,320
Of everything you can improve on,

645
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:48,960
you picked drinking?

646
00:42:49,040 --> 00:42:52,320
What if I had to drink at a social event?

647
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:54,120
I would hold my drinks better than before.

648
00:42:54,200 --> 00:42:56,120
Drinking is never mandatory
at any social event.

649
00:42:56,640 --> 00:42:58,480
Remember what I told you?

650
00:43:00,080 --> 00:43:00,920
Yes.

651
00:43:01,560 --> 00:43:03,560
Turn down drinks if I can.

652
00:43:04,360 --> 00:43:06,320
I don't like it
when you drink with someone else.

653
00:43:09,680 --> 00:43:10,800
Can you do that for me?

654
00:43:11,680 --> 00:43:12,680
Okay.

655
00:43:14,160 --> 00:43:15,000
Pinky promise.

656
00:43:15,720 --> 00:43:17,760
Whoever tells a lie

657
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:18,960
- will sink to the bad place.
- You're crazy.

658
00:43:26,120 --> 00:43:28,680
NORTHWESTERN CHINA

659
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,880
Hello, Yuanzhu.

660
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:44,120
I have come to your region!

661
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:21,520
Luke!

662
00:44:42,880 --> 00:44:45,400
Hongqi has put on some weight.

663
00:44:53,360 --> 00:44:56,960
I feel the atmosphere
at the office has been weird lately.

664
00:44:57,760 --> 00:44:59,440
Everyone has been gossiping.

665
00:45:03,720 --> 00:45:05,040
Focus on your work.

666
00:45:06,040 --> 00:45:07,760
Don't worry about other things.

667
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:09,520
Don't get yourself involved.

668
00:45:13,040 --> 00:45:14,160
Yes.

669
00:45:14,680 --> 00:45:18,240
Because I'm small and insignificant.
Who am I to worry about everything?

670
00:45:25,120 --> 00:45:26,080
You're small.

671
00:45:27,040 --> 00:45:27,960
But not insignificant.
